OL,3,GNEWSAMan extradited and charged with
OL,4,Ateen's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been extradited back to the
OL,7,FUK and charged with murder in the
OL,8,Finvestigation into the death of a
OL,9,F16-year-old in Manchester.
OL,11,FAlexander John Soyoye, known as John,
OL,12,Fdied after being stabbed in the Moston
OL,13,Farea of Manchester in November 2020.
OL,15,FNico de Carvalho Wilson, 24, has also
OL,16,Fbeen charged with manslaughter and
OL,17,Fviolent disorder.
